    "title": "Word Crush - Fun Puzzle Game",
    "description": "\ud83d\udcf2 <b>DOWNLOAD the best NEW word games free for adults & children NOW!</b> \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\n<b>Word Crush - Fun Puzzle Game</b> has exciting classic crossword & Scrabble puzzles for word enthusiasts and casual puzzle fun game lovers! \ud83e\udde0 You can test your word brain level through word searching and word connecting. Word Crush fun puzzles start as easy word games free for adults & children and get harder as you level up! \ud83d\udcc8\r\n\r\n<h2><b>ENJOY CHALLENGING & CLASSIC SCRABBLE WORD GAMEPLAY! </b></h2>\r\n\r\n- \ud83e\udde9 Train your word brain with addicting brand-new word games free for adults & children in fun games!\r\n- \u270d\ufe0f Swipe to connect letters and form words! This gameplay will test your skills through word search and word connect and prove your word brain level.\r\n- \ud83c\udfae Except for the classic crossword & Scrabble gameplay, you can get fun games from NEW mini-games, including Jam Crush, Tile Crush, Bingo, and more!\r\n- \ud83e\udd14 Can't figure out the word? You can use hints or props to help you get a clue to continue word searching or word connecting and win the level!\r\n\r\n<h2><b>FEATURES:</b></h2>\r\n\r\n- \ud83c\udf89 Amazing & Fun games! Word Crush - Fun Puzzle Game provides all word games free for adults & children.\r\n- \ud83d\udcb0 Daily bonus coins for free hints!\r\n- \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Multiple word game modes for endless fun!\r\n- \ud83d\udcda Thousands of fun games and word puzzles for you!\r\n- \ud83e\udde0 Expand your vocabulary and improve your spelling!\r\n- \ud83c\udfae Easy to play and difficulty increases as you go - the perfect word brain training game!\r\n- \ud83d\udcf6 Play word games free for adults & children OFFLINE or ONLINE - anytime, anywhere.\r\n- \ud83d\udcf2 For word games in single-player mode, download Word Crush for free word puzzles Now!\r\n\r\nGet Word Crush for the best new word game app for classic crossword Scrabble puzzle fans, word search or word connect game lovers, and more! \ud83c\udf1f Embark on an exciting word puzzle adventure that challenges your vocabulary and takes you through a series of engaging and thought-provoking puzzles & fun games.\r\n\r\nWith Word Crush - Fun Puzzle Game, dive into a vast world of classic crosswords where each puzzle solved is a step closer to becoming a NEW word master! \ud83c\udfc6 It's time to prove your word brain!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 <b>DOWNLOAD & Play</b> classic crossword & Scrabble games now in Word Crush - Fun Puzzle Game - it's so addictive! \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Contact us: <a href=\"http://WordCrushFeedback@gmail.com\">WordCrushFeedback@gmail.com</a>\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Follow our Facbook page: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FWordCrushGameOfficial%253Cbr%253E&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0xEnGHF467uKJCAAkigk2e\">https://www.facebook.com/WordCrushGameOfficial\r\n</a>\r\n\r\nPrivacy Link: https://bettagames.com/privacy",
